    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-10-25T15:55:59+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-25T15:55:59+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-25T05:25:59Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-25T05:25:59Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A ridge of high pressure moves into western SA and will persist over most the state, as the associated high drifts east across waters to the south, clearing east of Australia from Thursday. A trough and low pressure system are then forecast to track into western SA on Thursday before crossing the rest of the state on Friday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW014" description="North East Pastoral" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-10-25T15:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-26T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-25T04:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-25T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly clear. The chance of a thunderstorm north of Leigh Creek early this evening. Thunderstorms possibly severe with damaging winds in the far northeast early this evening. Winds southerly 30 to 45 km/h decreasing to 25 to 35 km/h in the late evening.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-10-26T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-27T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-25T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-26T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. Slight chance of a shower west of Leigh Creek, near zero chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm north of Oodnadatta from the late morning. Winds south to southeasterly 25 to 40 km/h. Overnight temperatures falling to between 5 and 17 with daytime temperatures reaching 21 to 30.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">High</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:10am to 4:50pm, UV Index predicted to reach 11 [Extreme]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-10-27T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-28T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-26T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-27T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers north of Leigh Creek, most likely in the late morning and afternoon. Near zero chance of rain elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm north of Leigh Creek. Winds south to southeasterly 20 to 30 km/h. Overnight temperatures falling to between 8 and 18 with daytime temperatures reaching 22 to 30.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-10-28T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-29T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-27T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-28T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. Slight chance of a shower north of Leigh Creek, near zero chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm north of Leigh Creek. Winds southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h. Overnight temperatures falling to between 9 and 18 with daytime temperatures reaching 24 to 32.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-10-29T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-30T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-28T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-29T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers west of Leigh Creek, slight chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm. Winds east to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h tending east to northeasterly 20 to 30 km/h during the morning. Overnight temperatures falling to between 11 and 21 with daytime temperatures reaching 26 to 32.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
